  "factionKiosks": {
    "notes": "Verdemorrow goods at the CCRE and GalCon faction kiosks for scrip. The cultivation machines are cheap but keep a crew fed indefinitely, so they ask Warm standing; seeds, nutrients, pipe, produce and meals are Neutral. Tier rule (docs/development/faction-kiosk-stock.md): supplies, materials and food Neutral, like the game's tools, batteries, ammunition and cladding; equipment under 10,000 credits and control boards Warm, like its nav modules and branded gear; equipment from 10,000 credits, hull-capture tools and combat-adjacent boards Friendly, like its railgun; equipment from 30,000 credits and the F6 centrepiece Trusted, like its PDCs; sections share their machine's tier; nothing at Honored.",
